<title>USA: Washington National Corp Q4 net off.</title>
<headline>Washington National Corp Q4 net off.</headline>
<dateline>LINCOLNSHIRE, Ill. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.63		    $0.74</p>
<p> Net			  7,907		    9,286</p>
<p> Revs			83,703		   80,505</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,508		   12,348</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1995 Q4 results include gain of $2.3 million or $0.18/shr from discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Q4 includes realized investment gains of $106,000 vs losses of $503,000.  </p>
<p>			    YEAR</p>
<p> Shr			$  0.48		    $2.73</p>
<p> Net			  6,328		   33,860</p>
<p> Revs		     328,707		  317,116</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  12,438		   12,250</p>
<p>	 (All Data Above 000s Except Per Share Numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 full-year results include loss on sale of health division of $25.1 million and loss of $919,000 from discontinued operations. The total loss was $2.09/shr on discontinued operations.</p>
<p>1995 full-year results include gain of $7.2 million or $0.58/shr from sale of discontinued operations.</p>
<p>Full-year results include realized investment gains of $634,000 vs losses of $1.4 million.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
